extends ../baseEmail

block content
  h1 Action Needed, #{payload.user.firstname}

  p We encountered an issue while trying to process your recent payout of #{payload.payoutAmount}. Unfortunately, the payout failed and was not completed.

  p This could be due to an issue with your bank account information or other restrictions. Please review your payout settings and ensure your bank details are correct.

  p If you need further assistance, our support team is here to help. You can also update your bank details directly on your dashboard.

  p
    a(href=payload.dashboardLink, class='btn btn-primary') Update Bank Details

  small We're here to support you. Thank you for using #{payload.appInfo.name}!
  br
  small
    b - #{payload.appInfo.appEmail}, #{payload.appInfo.appName}